{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"从前他总要先问值不值得，如今还没想透，也先接下自己能做的一份，尽力去做。\",\n      \"key\": \"尽力去做\",\n      \"follows\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"结果还没把握，疑虑和牵挂也还在，可他做着做着有了些力气，也有点骄傲，越投入越痛快。\",\n      \"key\": \"越投入越痛快\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是舍不得过去，也没找到放下它的理由；开始做眼前的事，并不能让过去回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"放下它的理由\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"一察觉自己又在惦记那些放不下的事，他就急着把心思拉回眼前，免得又陷回非得想透才肯动的老样子。\",\n      \"key\": \"拉回眼前\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"text\": \"一想到仍放不下的事，他就又难以把心思放在眼前的事上；可他还是重新提起劲，继续做自己能做的那一份。\",\n      \"key\": \"重新提起劲\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去对珍贵之物仍在却不能像从前一样拥有的复述，依据前文过去无法回来、他尚未找到放下理由的经历，说明他为什么仍舍不得。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他主动把心思拉回眼前的应对方式，删去反复自我劝说和暴露在意的复述，补出他这样做是为了不再陷入非得想透才肯行动的旧习惯。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去与珠子相近的不甘心和不安描写，保留他因放不下的事而难以继续投入，又重新提起劲做自己能做之事的因果循环。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "02160cc8-8c1d-45f5-9622-d7ba41bc5338", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T023051724671Z", "elapsed_seconds": 24.485, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T02:31:16.555689+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "dae6ebf2430755a0869c612aa5804e28515786ca480cc84027b8e83bb8468ccc", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T023051724671Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "d0fdff7d958ae3b1fcc30dfb14f043eb3659f759c71a8ba324597c924197f23e"}}}
